{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed records for the usage.sh and audit.sh tests (§11.5). Read into an in-memory",
    "Repository by chintanctl's --fixtures mode, so the tests run in CI with no AWS",
    "credentials and cannot reach an account.",
    "",
    "TWO TENANTS on purpose. t-alpha is the subject; t-beta exists so a cross-tenant leak",
    "is loud rather than subtle: its single record is 9.00 USD, which is past the §10.7",
    "ceiling, so any report for t-alpha that included it would flip from within_target to",
    "above_ceiling and change the exit code. §Phase 0 requires the cross-tenant test to run",
    "against the data layer and not only the API (I11), and these scripts ARE a data-layer",
    "caller.",
    "",
    "The t-alpha 2026-07 figures are the §10.7 model at a small scale, with the numbers",
    "chosen so the pricing cross-check is exact against config/instances/dev.yaml:",
    "groq_whisper_turbo is 0.04 USD/hour with a 10-second billing minimum (G-013), so the",
    "28s, 28s and 4s requests bill as 28 + 28 + 10 = 66 seconds = 733 micros, and the",
    "recorded costs below sum to the same 733. The 4-second record is the one that matters:",
    "a check derived from summed seconds instead of per-request minimums would expect 667",
    "and report a false 10% variance."
  ],
